{
  "_comment": [
    "The shipped baseline of PNP's interface layer: every wired interface",
    "joins the network it is plugged into, taking the address, the way out",
    "and the name servers that network offers, and self-assigning a",
    "link-local address while nobody answers.",
    "",
    "Two keys, because they answer two questions. Profiles\\default is how",
    "an interface stands on a network: every value here is a visible,",
    "deletable yes -- a bare profile believes nothing the network says and",
    "does nothing beyond bringing the link up. Rules\\Interface\\wired is",
    "which interfaces stand in it: a PNP rule over the Interface.* facts,",
    "priority 10 so anything an operator writes at the default 0 does not",
    "outrank it -- write a higher Priority to override, or an exception",
    "subkey under `wired` to specialise.",
    "",
    "Separate from the service definition on purpose. Starting netd and",
    "deciding that unknown wired interfaces should join whatever network",
    "they are plugged into are two decisions; a hardened image may want the",
    "first without the second and ship rules naming its interfaces instead.",
    "",
    "Wireless is not in the baseline until a supplicant exists. An",
    "interface no rule speaks for meets the compiled-in backstop, IGNORE,",
    "and is left exactly as the kernel left it."
  ],
  "keys": [
    { "path": "Machine\\System" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Profiles" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Profiles\\default",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Address.Offered", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "Address.LinkLocal", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "Route.Offered", "type": "dword", "data": 1 },
        { "name": "Dns.Offered", "type": "dword", "data": 1 }
      ]
    },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules" },
    { "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Interface" },
    {
      "path": "Machine\\System\\Network\\Rules\\Interface\\wired",
      "values": [
        { "name": "Interface.Kind.Equal", "type": "sz", "data": "wired" },
        { "name": "Priority", "type": "dword", "data": 10 },
        { "name": "Actions", "type": "multi", "data": ["JOIN(default)"] }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
